    "detailed_description": "SpecFreq is a top-down multiplayer shooter set in a dynamic and immersive modern battlefield. Engage in combat scenarios where skill, strategy, strafing, and teamwork are crucial for victory. Step into the boots of elite operatives known as 'SpecFreq agents,' each armed with cutting-edge weaponry and equipped with advanced gear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecFreq supports multiple zone types and game modes.  These include Capture the Flag, Warzone (Player vs Everyone), and more!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor those that played the old game Infantry, you'll find that SpecFreq is a modern take on it.  I'm not just updating the graphics, but I'm adding new features to bring it to the modern age.",
